kind: llman.sdd.delta
ops[6]{op,req_id,title,statement,from,to,name}:
  modify_requirement,as31,"agent-renamed-from-session",AgentSession MUST be renamed Agent to reflect that it is the pluggable capability aggregate (models + io + tools + orchestration state) rather than a session persistence object; Agent MUST compose the decomposed collaborator components per as32 and MUST retain its existing event stream and public API surface so call sites only change the type name.,null,null,null
  add_requirement,as40,"agent-rename-call-sites","The AgentSession to Agent rename MUST update every call site including agent/builder.rs, agent/runtime/react.rs, app/core/composition.rs, app/core/driver.rs, app/rpc.rs, app/server/rest.rs, tests/bdd.rs, and the public-API snapshot test; the snapshot MUST be regenerated and the rename MUST NOT change any behavior.",null,null,null
  add_requirement,as41,"permission-gate-extracted",A PermissionGate collaborator MUST hold the permission port and expose get_permission returning Arc<dyn XyPermission> so react.rs can keep doing tool_name to capability routing; the three dead check_permission_read/write/network wrapper methods (zero production call sites) MUST be removed.,null,null,null
  add_requirement,as42,"stats-compute-moved","The get_session_stats aggregation logic MUST move out of the Agent body into a compute function under agent/session/stats.rs taking the session store and session id; the Agent method MUST become a one-line delegate so the body holds no aggregation logic.",null,null,null
  add_requirement,as43,"trust-demoted-to-free-fn","The save_trust_decision method (which only reads self.cwd and does not hold a trust store) MUST be demoted to a free function under agent/session/trust.rs taking cwd, trust_store, and trusted; Agent MUST NOT carry this method since it has no cohesive reason to live on the capability aggregate.",null,null,null
  add_requirement,as44,"dead-code-cleared","After confirming zero production call sites via grep, the dead methods MUST be removed from Agent: the whole steering domain (steer, follow_up, clear_queue, pending_message_count, has_pending_steer, get_steering_messages, get_follow_up_messages, drain_queued_messages, message_queue, message_queue_mut), process_prompt, cycle_forward, cycle_backward, share_as_gist, registry_clone, set_append_prompt, compact_current_session, compaction_threshold, compaction_settings, register_template, register_templates, register_command, and register_skill_commands; dead #[allow(dead_code)] attributes MUST be removed alongside.",null,null,null
op_scenarios[7]{req_id,id,given,when,then}:
  as40,"agent-session-renamed",the source tree after the rename,"rg '\\bAgentSession\\b' src/ tests/ runs",zero matches remain and Agent is the capability aggregate
  as40,"snapshot-regenerated","the public-API snapshot existed for AgentSession",the snapshot test runs,it passes against the renamed Agent type after regeneration
  as41,"permission-gate-exists",the permission port was a bare field on the Agent,the change is applied,a PermissionGate struct holds it and get_permission still returns the Arc for react routing
  as42,"stats-delegate",get_session_stats held inline aggregation,the Agent method is inspected,"its body is a one-line delegate to stats::compute"
  as43,"trust-free-fn",save_trust_decision lived on the Agent,the change is applied,it is a free function in agent/session/trust.rs and the Agent no longer carries it
  as44,"dead-methods-gone",the steering domain and other dead methods existed,rg for those method names in src/agent/ runs,no production dead methods remain (only legitimately used methods survive)
  as31,"agent-renamed-from-session","AgentSession was the 25-field capability aggregate called Session",the change is applied,"it is named Agent, composes the as32 collaborators, and retains its event stream and public API"
